{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgr3qVzd3kkfc6s31Bx3b","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't open the repository, so this diagnosis comes from the retrieved snippets and my memory of the NestJS boilerplate layout. None of the snippets contains the defect. I haven't checked the file paths or line ranges against the actual files.\n\nThe photo URL in user responses comes from a `@Transform` on the file's `path` property. For the local driver, that transform most likely builds the URL with the frontend domain instead of the backend domain. I expect it in the `FileType` domain class and, as a second candidate, in the relational `FileEntity`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":7614,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c63a8eea-0327-4573-a8d6-ed9d794c38f7","uuid":"d1c7605f-a1cc-419d-b975-2e5f2c4ad00c","timestamp":"2026-11-08T19:56:17.202Z","request_id":"req_011Cgr3qVeXZF9oK3uGLUdxF"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgr3qVzd3kkfc6s31Bx3b","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HNrmYQ5a5iD5uLCyMg8jXJ","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"candidates":[{"file":"src/files/domain/file.ts","symbol":"FileType.path","start_line":14,"end_line":40,"explanation":"The @Transform on `path` handles the FileDriver.LOCAL case. It most likely prefixes the stored path with appConfig().frontendDomain instead of appConfig().backendDomain. The photo URL in user responses (/auth/me) therefore points at the web app host, where the avatar is not served. The local files controller is served by the backend."},{"file":"src/files/infrastructure/persistence/relational/entities/file.entity.ts","symbol":"FileEntity.path","start_line":15,"end_line":40,"explanation":"If the entity carries its own path @Transform, its LOCAL branch could have the same frontendDomain mistake, which would also affect serialized user photos."}],"fix":{"file":"src/files/domain/file.ts","description":"In the @Transform for `path`, change the FileDriver.LOCAL branch to return `appConfig().backendDomain + value` instead of `appConfig().frontendDomain + value`. Apply the same change to any duplicate transform in the relational FileEntity."}},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":7614,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c63a8eea-0327-4573-a8d6-ed9d794c38f7","uuid":"0527841c-7eef-4c93-9cb1-cca24b33396d","timestamp":"2026-11-08T19:56:19.581Z","request_id":"req_011Cgr3qVeXZF9oK3uGLUdxF"}
